## 🚀 Getting Started

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ddhyuthigowda-ai/my-day-analyzer.git
```

### 2. Open the project

```bash
cd my-day-analyzer
```

### 3. Create a virtual environment

Windows:

```powershell
python -m venv venv
```

### 4. Activate the virtual environment

PowerShell:

```powershell
venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

If successful, your terminal should show:

```text
(venv)
```

### 5. Install dependencies

If a `requirements.txt` file is included:

```powershell
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 6. Run the application

```powershell
python app.py
```

You should see Flask start the development server.

Open the local address shown in your terminal, usually:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

